  "body": "<h2 id=\"venue-112\">CCIB - Centre de Convencions Internacional de Barcelona</h2><p>Plaça de Willy Brandt, 11-14,  08019, Barcelona, Spain, ES</p>\n<img alt=\"CCIB - Centre de Convencions Internacional de Barcelona\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/112/images/_resampled/FillWyIxNTAwIiwiMzUwIl0/CCIB.jpg\" />\n<details id=\"floor_4\"><summary>P1</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/112/floors/CCIB-3-P1-AC-P3.jpg\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"CCIB - Centre de Convencions Internacional de Barcelona — P1\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/112/floors/CCIB-3-P1-AC-P3.jpg\" /></details>\n<details id=\"floor_5\"><summary>P0</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/112/floors/CCIB-1-P0-Forum.jpg\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"CCIB - Centre de Convencions Internacional de Barcelona — P0\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/112/floors/CCIB-1-P0-Forum.jpg\" /></details>\n<details id=\"floor_6\"><summary>P2</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/112/floors/CCIB-5-P2.jpg\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"CCIB - Centre de Convencions Internacional de Barcelona — P2\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/112/floors/CCIB-5-P2.jpg\" /></details>\n<h2 id=\"venue-129\">Hilton Diagonal Mar</h2><p>Carrer del Taulat, 262-264,  Barcelona, ES</p>\n<img alt=\"Hilton Diagonal Mar\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/129/images/_resampled/FillWyIxNTAwIiwiMzUwIl0/hilton-diagonal-mar-barcelona-21.jpg\" />\n<details id=\"floor_1\"><summary>P0</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/129/floors/Hilton-P0.jpg\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"Hilton Diagonal Mar — P0\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/129/floors/Hilton-P0.jpg\" /></details>\n<details id=\"floor_2\"><summary>P1</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/129/floors/Hilton-P1.jpg\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"Hilton Diagonal Mar — P1\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/129/floors/Hilton-P1.jpg\" /></details>\n<details><summary>P2</summary><p>No floor-plan image is published for this level.</p></details>\n<h2 id=\"venue-162\">AC Hotel</h2><p>Passeig del Taulat, 278, Barcelona, ES</p>\n<img alt=\"AC Hotel\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/162/images/_resampled/FillWyIxNTAwIiwiMzUwIl0/ACBarcelonaForum.jpg\" />\n<details id=\"floor_7\"><summary>P1</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/162/floors/AC-P1.jpg\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"AC Hotel — P1\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/162/floors/AC-P1.jpg\" /></details>\n<details id=\"floor_8\"><summary>P3</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/162/floors/AC-P3.jpg\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"AC Hotel — P3\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/162/floors/AC-P3.jpg\" /></details>\n<details id=\"floor_9\"><summary>P4</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/162/floors/AC-P4.jpg\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"AC Hotel — P4\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/162/floors/AC-P4.jpg\" /></details>\n<details id=\"floor_10\"><summary>P14</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/162/floors/AC-P14.jpg\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"AC Hotel — P14\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/162/floors/AC-P14.jpg\" /></details>\n<h2 id=\"venue-185\">All Venues (CCIB, AC Hotel)</h2><p>Hilton Diagonal Mar, Barcelona, ES</p>\n<img alt=\"All Venues (CCIB, AC Hotel)\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/185/images/_resampled/FillWyIxNTAwIiwiMzUwIl0/Aerial-REV1.jpg\" />\n<details id=\"floor_11\"><summary>All Campus Map</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/185/floors/Aerial-REV1.jpg\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"All Venues (CCIB, AC Hotel) — All Campus Map\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/7/locations/185/floors/Aerial-REV1.jpg\" /></details>",
