      "lat": 41.4088636,
      "lng": 2.2176587,
      "body": "<p><span>This contemporary hotel is a 7-minute walk from the beach and 4.1 km from La Sagrada Familia.</span><span> </span><span class=\"_dgc kd-hc\" data-ved=\"0ahUKEwie7YjWt8bOAhUK4mMKHcmTAPAQ3E0IwgEwDg\"><span class=\"_I5e\"><br><br>All rooms offer upscale decor and custom-designed beds, plus flat-screen TVs, minibars, coffeemakers and paid WiFi. Executive rooms offer free WiFi and access to the Executive Lounge’s free breakfast and evening appetizers. Suites add separate living areas.</span><span class=\"_I5e\"><br><br>Breakfast is available (fee), and there’s a restaurant serving Mediterranean/Catalan cuisine, as well as a chic bar and a cafe. There's also a fitness center, a seasonal outdoor pool, a children's pool and saunas. Additional amenities include a ballroom, 15 meeting rooms and a business center.</span></span></p>"
